        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716790/extras/e4f2b178cd71f7137d45f20f09675601.poster.avif?t=1773060926\" width=600 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716790/extras/e4f2b178cd71f7137d45f20f09675601.webm?t=1773060926\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716790/extras/e4f2b178cd71f7137d45f20f09675601.mp4?t=1773060926\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Majoris Nightmare</strong> is a dark narrative-driven puzzle-adventure built around investigation, tension, and consequence. After tragedy shatters his life, Majoris enters a seemingly ordinary house in search of answers, believing its owner may be connected to his daughter's disappearance. Solving puzzles requires close attention to notes and details. Overlook them and you may find yourself lost. Face rare moments of danger, make difficult choices, and remember that a single wrong move could mean losing her forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716790/extras/9ad7da73d879ae926b37d286ed5e231c.poster.avif?t=1773060926\" width=600 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716790/extras/9ad7da73d879ae926b37d286ed5e231c.webm?t=1773060926\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716790/extras/9ad7da73d879ae926b37d286ed5e231c.mp4?t=1773060926\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Majoris searches for his daughter, the world around him shifts in unexpected and dangerous ways. He must stay quick and alert to survive these moments of sudden threat and keep his hope alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716790/extras/cfb87e17060cd6188233eae7766c423e.poster.avif?t=1773060926\" width=600 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716790/extras/cfb87e17060cd6188233eae7766c423e.webm?t=1773060926\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716790/extras/cfb87e17060cd6188233eae7766c423e.mp4?t=1773060926\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not all obstacles come from the world itself. Some are left behind by those who don’t want Majoris to uncover the truth. Solving puzzles, finding clues, and unlocking hidden paths are the only way forward because each challenge is designed to slow him down or throw him off course.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716790/extras/827ec18becf41015ad05d1890fe98b9b.poster.avif?t=1773060926\" width=600 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716790/extras/827ec18becf41015ad05d1890fe98b9b.webm?t=1773060926\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716790/extras/827ec18becf41015ad05d1890fe98b9b.mp4?t=1773060926\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With years of experience as a journalist, Majoris knows how to follow a lead. Scattered notes and hidden writings hold pieces of the truth and only by reading carefully and piecing them together can he hope to get closer to his missing daughter. Every detail matters in this dark, immersive puzzle adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716790/extras/2dbb8053e9138e229f0f67addab0bb09.poster.avif?t=1773060926\" width=600 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716790/extras/2dbb8053e9138e229f0f67addab0bb09.webm?t=1773060926\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716790/extras/2dbb8053e9138e229f0f67addab0bb09.mp4?t=1773060926\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Majoris has already lost someone he loved. He refuses to let it happen again. No matter the cost, he will uncover the truth and bring his daughter back. She is his last reason to keep going and he won’t stop until she’s safe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Note Collection: </strong>Explore and gather scattered notes that help Majoris piece together the story and uncover where his daughter might be. Reading and understanding them is essential. Missing key details may leave you lost or unable to progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Single Enemy Encounter</strong>: React fast and shoot the only creature standing in your way before it reaches you. Timing is everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzle Solving</strong>: Progress through the game by solving different types of puzzles using logic, observation, and exploration. Clues hidden in the world and notes often hold the answers. Only those who pay attention will succeed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Critical Decision-Making</strong>: Make a single key choice that determines whether Majoris will succeed or lose what matters most.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High-Tension Moment</strong>: Experience a one-time quick time event that demands fast reflexes to escape danger.</p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716790/extras/e4f2b178cd71f7137d45f20f09675601.poster.avif?t=1773060926\" width=600 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716790/extras/e4f2b178cd71f7137d45f20f09675601.webm?t=1773060926\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716790/extras/e4f2b178cd71f7137d45f20f09675601.mp4?t=1773060926\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Majoris Nightmare</strong> is a dark narrative-driven puzzle-adventure built around investigation, tension, and consequence. After tragedy shatters his life, Majoris enters a seemingly ordinary house in search of answers, believing its owner may be connected to his daughter's disappearance. Solving puzzles requires close attention to notes and details. Overlook them and you may find yourself lost. Face rare moments of danger, make difficult choices, and remember that a single wrong move could mean losing her forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716790/extras/9ad7da73d879ae926b37d286ed5e231c.poster.avif?t=1773060926\" width=600 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716790/extras/9ad7da73d879ae926b37d286ed5e231c.webm?t=1773060926\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716790/extras/9ad7da73d879ae926b37d286ed5e231c.mp4?t=1773060926\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Majoris searches for his daughter, the world around him shifts in unexpected and dangerous ways. He must stay quick and alert to survive these moments of sudden threat and keep his hope alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716790/extras/cfb87e17060cd6188233eae7766c423e.poster.avif?t=1773060926\" width=600 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716790/extras/cfb87e17060cd6188233eae7766c423e.webm?t=1773060926\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716790/extras/cfb87e17060cd6188233eae7766c423e.mp4?t=1773060926\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not all obstacles come from the world itself. Some are left behind by those who don’t want Majoris to uncover the truth. Solving puzzles, finding clues, and unlocking hidden paths are the only way forward because each challenge is designed to slow him down or throw him off course.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716790/extras/827ec18becf41015ad05d1890fe98b9b.poster.avif?t=1773060926\" width=600 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716790/extras/827ec18becf41015ad05d1890fe98b9b.webm?t=1773060926\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716790/extras/827ec18becf41015ad05d1890fe98b9b.mp4?t=1773060926\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With years of experience as a journalist, Majoris knows how to follow a lead. Scattered notes and hidden writings hold pieces of the truth and only by reading carefully and piecing them together can he hope to get closer to his missing daughter. Every detail matters in this dark, immersive puzzle adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716790/extras/2dbb8053e9138e229f0f67addab0bb09.poster.avif?t=1773060926\" width=600 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716790/extras/2dbb8053e9138e229f0f67addab0bb09.webm?t=1773060926\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716790/extras/2dbb8053e9138e229f0f67addab0bb09.mp4?t=1773060926\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Majoris has already lost someone he loved. He refuses to let it happen again. No matter the cost, he will uncover the truth and bring his daughter back. She is his last reason to keep going and he won’t stop until she’s safe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Note Collection: </strong>Explore and gather scattered notes that help Majoris piece together the story and uncover where his daughter might be. Reading and understanding them is essential. Missing key details may leave you lost or unable to progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Single Enemy Encounter</strong>: React fast and shoot the only creature standing in your way before it reaches you. Timing is everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzle Solving</strong>: Progress through the game by solving different types of puzzles using logic, observation, and exploration. Clues hidden in the world and notes often hold the answers. Only those who pay attention will succeed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Critical Decision-Making</strong>: Make a single key choice that determines whether Majoris will succeed or lose what matters most.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High-Tension Moment</strong>: Experience a one-time quick time event that demands fast reflexes to escape danger.</p></li></ul>",
